  "body": "PR #1223 (merged) added the MCP tool `edit_machine` (RFC 7396 merge patch over the mounted machine; unknown keys refused by name; one undo) without its row in `.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md`. Add the row (parameters, the null-removes-a-key rule, the refusal behaviour, undo), and in the same PR any other shipped tool whose row is missing - check the server's `tools/list` table against the skill table. It is a process file: bump `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION` and announce on #681.\n\nDone means: every tool in `tools/list` has a skill row; PROCESS_VERSION bumped; #681 announced on merge.",
